WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:12.248
Percent means out of one hundred, so twenty-five percent is twenty-five out of one

00:00:12.248 --> 00:00:14.530
hundred, or one quarter.

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:25.501
To find a percent of an amount, turn the percent into a decimal and multiply. Twenty

00:00:25.501 --> 00:00:28.322
percent of eighty is sixteen.

00:00:31.122 --> 00:00:38.943
Ratios compare amounts; keep a proportion balanced by multiplying both parts by the

00:00:38.943 --> 00:00:40.074
same number.
